      "id": "sources_text",
      "x": 3.6666259765625,
      "y": 47.25003051757815,
      "width": 186.9140625,
      "height": 302.5,
      "text": "    7 RULE SOURCES\n    \n    globalSettings\n      ~/.claude/settings.json\n      (user-controlled)\n    \n    projectSettings\n      .claude/settings.json\n      (repo, UNTRUSTED)\n    \n    workspaceSettings\n\n.claude/settings.local.json\n    \n    enterpriseSettings\n      Remote managed (MDM)\n    \n    cliArg (--flags)\n    \n    command (/permissions)\n    \n    session (runtime adds)",
