      "width": 193.359375,
      "height": 137.5,
      "text": "    Deny checked FIRST\n    (project can't override user)\n    \n    Deny rules are CUMULATIVE\n    (any source can deny)\n    \n    Allow rules: LATEST WINS\n    (session overrides project)\n    \n    Default action: ASK\n    (never auto-allow uncertain)",
